    "Only rounded intervals, elapsed minutes and calculated window limits are sent. Names, birth dates, notes, photos, child IDs, exact event dates and Baby Buddy credentials are excluded. These patterns can still reveal health information.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only rounded intervals, elapsed minutes and calculated window limits are sent. Names, birth dates, notes, photos, child IDs, exact event dates and Baby Buddy credentials are excluded. These patterns can still reveal health information."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Übertragen werden nur gerundete Abstände, vergangene Minuten und berechnete Zeitgrenzen. Namen, Geburtsdaten, Notizen, Fotos, Kinder-IDs, genaue Ereigniszeitpunkte und Baby-Buddy-Zugangsdaten bleiben auf dem Gerät. Die Muster können dennoch Rückschlüsse auf Gesundheitsinformationen erlauben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional comparison using a service and API key you supply yourself.": {
